     proof                  3       1    33.3%          114
     generalize             3       0     0.0%            5
     change                 3       0     0.0%            0

   ■ '미상' 실제 예 (오탐 확인용)
     Build_Diagram            ← srapply Build_Diagram.
     TyUni                    ← capply TyUni.
     ZeroR                    ← assert (forall n, ZeroR [<] nring (S n)) as H_asrt0.
     fs1                      ← have [sf [ff _] f0 fs1 fs2] := (L5 h a pN).
     fs2                      ← have [sf [ff _] f0 fs1 fs2] := (L5 h a pN).
     nzsimpl                  ← unfold Z.pred, Z.succ, Z.eq; intro n; simpl; now nzsimpl.
     order_tac                ← move:pyz;rewrite -eq2; move => [aux _]; order_tac.
     Hcmp'                    ← destruct (AsciiOT.compare c2 c1) as [? | ? | ?] f2:Hcmp'.

